  "bio": "\"Instattoosionalized, nestled in the heart of Northampton, is a premier tattoo studio where artistry meets precision. Specializing in illustrative styles, our skilled tattooists craft each design with meticulous care in a vibrant and welcoming environment. Visit us at 1852 Main St. Northampton, PA, where we're open Monday-Saturday to transform your visions into inked masterpieces.\"\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Northampton, Pennsylvania, United States"
